OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centres now hubs for
OL,4,Apre-loved baby items
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisations are making it easier to
OL,7,Fdonate pre-loved baby items at
OL,8,Frecycling centres for vulnerable
OL,9,Ffamilies.
OL,11,FBaby Basics, based in Wollaston,
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, has partnered with
OL,13,FFCC Environment and West
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire Council (WNC).
OL,16,FThey are urging people visiting certain
OL,17,Frecycling centres in Northamptonshire
OL,18,Fto donate pre-loved baby items,
OL,19,Fincluding clothing, toiletries, and
OL,20,Fequipment, as part of a coordinated
OL,21,Feffort to support families in need
OL,22,Facross the county.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
